    "pc_animation_steps": "func_08109EF8 selects a PcAnimStep stream through the 14-entry index; callers use constants 0,11,12,13, branch-selected values 5..10, and state values assigned 0..3. func_08109F20 consumes opcode0 steps and advances after duration unk_22; opcode1 restarts at step0 and opcode2 stops. Each independently traversed stream therefore includes its first opcode1/2 terminal record. The 14 derived extents partition 190 real36-byte records without gaps or overlap, ending exactly at the separately declared gUnk_09A4C9EC scalar table. All6840 source-record bytes and every stream count/opcode agree across US,JP,EU. Padding halfwords at2,10,26 are zero. The raw step records are source-level boss animation commands, not encoded graphics, and the index is real runtime data. All names retain the existing US address convention; no pointer casting or synthetic arrays are used."
